---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import StickyNav from "../components/StickyNav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBanner from "../components/CtaBanner.astro";

import Reviews from "../components/Reviews.astro";
const phone = "tel:+14077343968";
const phoneDisplay = "407-734-3968";
---

<Layout
  title="Alafaya & UCF Plumber | Bonet Plumbing LLC"
  description="Alafaya & UCF-area high-value plumbing — whole-home repiping, tankless water heaters, slab leak repair, sewer & gas line work. Licensed & insured (CFC1434246). Call 407-734-3968."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", url: "https://bonetplumbing.com/" },
    { name: "Service Areas", url: "https://bonetplumbing.com/#service-areas" },
    { name: "Alafaya Plumber" }
  ]}
>
  <StickyNav />
  <main>
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/[0.03] via-white to-white py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text leading-tight mb-4">
          Alafaya Plumber — Serving Families & Property Managers
        </h1>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full mb-6"></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Whether you own a family home or manage rental properties along Alafaya Trail, plumbing problems demand fast, professional help. We arrive same-day, explain what's wrong in plain language, and give you an upfront price before we start.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-10">
          <a href={phone} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z"/>
            </svg>
            Call Now: {phoneDisplay}
          </a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Get a Free Estimate
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-6">High-Value Plumbing Services in Alafaya & UCF</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
          <a href="/repiping" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Whole-Home Repiping</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Aging galvanized or polybutylene pipes replaced with modern PEX or copper — full pressure restored, leaks gone for decades.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/water-heater-services" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Water Heaters & Tankless</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Same-day replacement and tankless conversion (Rinnai, Navien, Rheem) for endless hot water and lower bills.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/repiping#slab-leak" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Slab Leak Repair</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Warm floor spots or a spiking water bill? We locate and reroute slab leaks before they damage your foundation.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/repiping#sewer-line" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Sewer Line Replacement</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Trenchless replacement of collapsed, root-invaded, or bellied sewer lines — without tearing up the yard.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/water-heater-services#gas-line" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Gas Line Installation</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">New gas lines for tankless heaters, generators, pool heaters, and outdoor kitchens — permitted and leak-tested.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/repiping#water-main" class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Water Main Replacement</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Leaking service line from the meter to your home? We replace it, often trenchless, to restore full flow.</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-4">Plumbing in Alafaya & UCF: What We See Most</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-4 max-w-2xl">The Alafaya Trail corridor near the University of Central Florida is packed with subdivisions built in the 1990s and 2000s, mixed in with a lot of rentals and student housing, and bordered by Waterford Lakes and Avalon Park. Those homes are now hitting the age where the original water heaters give out and polybutylene runs start failing — and because most are built slab-on-grade, the leaks often show up under the foundation rather than in a wall.</p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-10 max-w-2xl">That mix is exactly what we work on every day out here. The heavy rental turnover means owners and property managers can't wait around: when a repipe or water-heater swap needs to happen between tenants, it has to be done fast, done right, and properly permitted. We handle that, and we handle the slab leaks the local soil and construction make so common in this part of east Orange County.</p>

        <CtaBanner
          heading="Need a Plumber in Alafaya or Near UCF?"
          sub="Free estimates, upfront pricing, and same-day service from a licensed local plumber."
        />

        <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">What You Get</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Your home is protected — licensed (CFC1434246) & fully insured in Florida</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Same-day service for the Alafaya corridor and surrounding neighborhoods</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">You'll know the price before we start — no hidden fees, no surprises</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Save 15% on all repairs & installations — available to Alafaya residents</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href={phone} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Call Now: {phoneDisplay}
          </a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Get a Free Estimate
          </a>
        </div>

        <nav class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-border" aria-label="Other service areas">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-4">Nearby Service Areas</h2>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <li><a href="/oviedo-plumber" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Oviedo</a></li>
            <li><a href="/east-orlando-plumber" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">East Orlando</a></li>
            <li><a href="/winter-springs-plumber" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Winter Springs</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Reviews />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
